WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.130
Fill a bath.

00:00:02.130 --> 00:00:04.670
What does the water height graph look like?

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:06.310
It rises steadily.

00:00:06.310 --> 00:00:08.880
Turn the tap off: it goes flat.

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:11.350
Pull the plug: it falls.

00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:14.016
A sketch tells the whole story.
